#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Please choose a Color for the Graph HRULE for the Warning Thresholds.  Choose 'None' for No HRULE.  Note: This features is supported for Data Manipulation types 'Exact Value' and 'Percentage' only at this time."
msgstr "እባክዎ ለማስጠንቀቂያ ገደቦች ለግራፍ HRULE ቀለም ይምረጡ። HRULE እንዳይኖር 'ምንም' የሚለውን ይምረጡ። ማስታወሻ: ይህ ባህሪ በአሁኑ ጊዜ የሚደገፈው ለ'ትክክለኛ እሴት' እና 'መቶኛ' የውሂብ ማቀነባበሪያ ዓይነቶች ብቻ ነው።"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Alert HRULE Color"
msgstr "የማንቂያ HRULE ቀለም"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Please choose a Color for the Graph HRULE for the Alert Thresholds.  Choose 'None' for No HRULE.  Note: This features is supported for Data Manipulation types 'Exact Value' and 'Percentage' only at this time."
msgstr "እባክዎ ለማንቂያ ገደቦች ለግራፍ HRULE ቀለም ይምረጡ። HRULE እንዳይኖር 'ምንም' የሚለውን ይምረጡ። ማስታወሻ: ይህ ባህሪ በአሁኑ ጊዜ የሚደገፈው ለ'ትክክለኛ እሴት' እና 'መቶኛ' የውሂብ ማቀነባበሪያ ዓይነቶች ብቻ ነው።"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Graph Timespan"
msgstr "የግራፍ የጊዜ ገደብ"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "The Graph End time will be set at the time of triggering.  The Graph Start time will be the End Time minus the Graph Timespan."
msgstr "የግራፍ መጨረሻ ሰዓት በመቀስቀሻው ጊዜ ይዘጋጃል። የግራፍ መጀመሪያ ሰዓት የመጨረሻ ሰዓት ሲቀነስ የግራፍ የጊዜ ርዝመት ይሆናል።"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
